tures</a><a href={SITE_URL + "/b2b-glossary"} class="mm-drop_link">B2B glossary</a><a href="https://b2bware.com/interactive-demo/" class="mm-drop_link">Interactive demo</a><a href={SITE_URL + "/partner-program"} class="mm-drop_link">Partner program</a><a href={SITE_URL + "/contact"} class="mm-drop_link">Contact us</a></div></div><div class="nav_item"><a href={SITE_URL + "/pricing"} class="nav_link">Pricing</a></div></nav><div class="nav_actions"><a type="button" href="#" class="nav_lang w-button">English<svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" height="16" width="16" class="nav_chevron nav_chevron"><path stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" d="M3.333 5.667 8 10.333l4.667-4.666"></path></svg></a><a href="#" class="button is-secondary is-small">Start 3-day free trial</a><a href={SITE_URL + "/#order-check"} class="button is-small">Book a free consultation</a></div><a type="button" aria-label="Menu" href="#" class="nav_burger w-button"><span class="nav_burger-line"></span><span class="nav_burger-line"></span><span class="nav_burger-line"></span></a></div><div class="mm is-solutions"><div class="mm_inner"><div class="mm_side"><div class="mm_eyebrow">Solutions</div><div class="mm_title">Who do you want to sell to online?</div><p class="mm_intro">Pick the entry point that fits you best – by target audience, business model or industry.</p><div class="mm_tabs"><a type="button" data-tab="audience" href="#" class="mm_tab is-active w-button"><span class="mm_tab-num">1</span><span class="mm_tab-label">Target audience<span class="mm_tab-sub">Who do you want to reach?</span></span></a><a type="button" data-tab="business" href="#" class="mm_tab w-button"><span class="mm_tab-num">2</span><span class="mm_tab-label">What we fix<span class="mm_tab-sub">What is not working?</span></span></a><a type="button" data-tab="industry" href="#" class="mm_tab w-button"><span class="mm_tab-num">3</span><span class="mm_tab-label">Industry<span class="mm_tab-sub">What industry are you in?</span></span></a></div><div class="mm_help"><div class="mm_help-title">Not sure?</div><div>We’re happy to advise you personally and find the right solution for your company together.</div><a href={SITE_URL + "/contact"} class="mm_help-link">Contact us now →</a></div></div><div class="mm_panes"><div data-pane="audience" class="mm_pane is-active"><div class="mm_grid"><a href={SITE_URL + "/solutions/b2b"} class="mm_card w-inline-block"><img src="/images/menu/menu-b2b.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="/images/menu/menu-b2b-p-500.webp 500w, /images/menu/menu-b2b.webp 572w" alt="B2B buyer ordering on a tablet" class="mm_card-img"/><span class="mm_tag">B2B</span><span class="mm_card-title">Businesses</span><p class="mm_card-text">For retailers, wholesalers, commercial customers and business partners.</p><ul role="list" class="mm_checks"><li>✓ Individual pricing</li><li>✓ Fast ordering processes</li><li>✓ Strong partner solutions</li></ul><span class="mm_cta">Discover B2B solutions →</span></a><a href={SITE_URL + "/solutions/b2c"} class="mm_card w-inline-block"><img src="/images/menu/menu-b2c.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="/images/menu/menu-b2c-p-500.webp 500w, /images/menu/menu-b2c.webp 572w" alt="Consumer shopping online" class="mm_card-img"/><span class="mm_tag is-blue">B2C</span><span class="mm_card-title">End customers</span><p class="mm_card-text">For direct sales to private customers.</p><ul role="list" class="mm_checks"><li>✓ Simple ordering processes</li><li>✓ Diverse payment methods</li><li>✓ Optimized for all devices</li></ul><span class="mm_cta is-blue">Discover B2C solutions →</span></a><a href={SITE_URL + "/solutions/b2c"} class="mm_card w-inline-block"><img src="/images/menu/menu-b2b-b2c.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="/images/menu/menu-b2b-b2c-p-500.webp 500w, /images/menu/menu-b2b-b2c.webp 572w" alt="Team packing orders for business and private customers" class="mm_card-img"/><span class="mm_tag is-purple">B2B <!-- -->&amp;<!-- --> B2C</span><span class="mm_card-title">Businesses <!-- -->&amp;<!-- --> end customers</span><p class="mm_card-text">Combine both sales channels in one platform.</p><ul role="list" class="mm_checks"><li>✓ Central platform</li><li>✓ Flexible sales channels</li><li>✓ Maximum reach</li></ul><span class="mm_cta is-purple">Discover B2B <!-- -->&amp;<!-- --> B2C solutions →</span></a></div><div class="mm_aside"><div class="mm_eyebrow">The right solution for your goals</div><div class="mm_aside-title">More growth. More possibilities.</div><p class="mm_aside-text">Reach any target audience – B2B, B2C or both – with one high-performance platform.</p><a href={SITE_URL + "/#order-check"} class="button is-block">Book a free consultation</a><img src="/images/menu/menu-dashboard.webp" loading="lazy" alt="B2Bware dashboard" class="mm_aside-img"/></div></div><div data-pane="business" class="mm_pane"><div class="mm_grid is-4"><a href={SITE_URL + "/solutions/trade-portal"} class="mm_card w-inline-block"><img src="/images/online-ordering.jpg" loading="lazy" alt="Trade portal with customer-specific prices" class="mm_card-img"/><span class="mm_card-title">Same reorders by phone and email</span><p class="mm_card-text">Trade customers reorder online at their own prices, straight into your ERP.</p><span class="mm_cta">Trade portal →</span></a><a href={SITE_URL + "/solutions/erp-integration"} class="mm_card w-inline-block"><img src="/images/erp-sync.jpg" loading="lazy" alt="Shop and ERP in sync" class="mm_card-img"/><span class="mm_card-title">Shop and ERP out of sync</span><p class="mm_card-text">Prices, stock and orders that match your ERP, kept running for you.</p><span class="mm_cta">ERP integration →</span></a><a href={SITE_URL + "/solutions/emailed-orders"} class="mm_card w-inline-block"><img src="/images/emailed-orders.jpg" loading="lazy" alt="Emailed orders read into the ERP" class="mm_card-img"/><span class="mm_card-title">Emailed orders retyped</span><p class="mm_card-text">PDF, email and Excel orders read and posted to your ERP.</p><span class="mm_cta">Emailed orders →</span></a><a href={SITE_URL + "/solutions/b2c"} class="mm_card w-inline-block"><img src="/images/menu/menu-b2c.webp" loading="lazy" alt="Consumer shopping online" class="mm_card-img"/><span class="mm_card-title">Consumer shop and ERP apart</span><p class="mm_card-text">A consumer web shop built on your ERP, not bolted on.</p><span class="mm_cta">Consumer shop →</span></a></div><div class="mm_aside"><div class="mm_eyebrow">The right platform for your business</div><div class="mm_aside-title">Maximum efficiency. Zero data silos.</div><p class="mm_aside-text">Connect your ERP to every sales channel and manage all your B2B and B2C customers from one platform.</p><a href={SITE_URL + "/#order-check"} class="button is-block">Book a free consultation</a><img src="/images/menu/menu-dashboard.webp" loading="lazy" alt="B2Bware dashboard" class="mm_aside-img"/></div></div><div data-pane="industry" class="mm_pane"><div class="mm_col"><div class="mm_grid is-4"><a href={SITE_URL + "/industries/logistics-fulfillment"} class="mm_card w-inline-block"><img src="/images/menu/menu-ind-logistics.webp" loading="lazy" alt="Logistics conveyor" class="mm_card-img is-wide"/><span class="mm_card-title">Logistics <!-- -->&amp;<!-- --> Fulfillment</span><p class="mm_card-text">For logistics companies, fulfillment providers and dispatchers.</p><span class="mm_card-link">Discover solutions →</span></a><a href={SITE_URL + "/industries/construction"} class="mm_card w-inline-block"><img src="/images/menu/menu-ind-construction.webp" loading="lazy" alt="Construction site with cranes" class="mm_card-img is-wide"/><span class="mm_card-title">Construction</span><p class="mm_card-text">For building materials dealers, contractors and the trade.</p><span class="mm_card-link">Discover solutions →</span></a><a href={SITE_URL + "/industries/electronic-components"} class="mm_card w-i